  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/piggyback_title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<div><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faewulf/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaeWulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\"> </a></div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\"> </a></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>📑 概述</h2>\n<p><strong>Piggyback Rides</strong> 是一款有趣且小巧的模组，它将 Minecraft 默认的坐下的机制改变为更自然的“骑牛背”式骑行。你不再是坐在另一个玩家的头上，而是骑在他们的背上，非常适合合作冒险、搞笑角色扮演或混乱的局面！</p>\n<h2>📦 功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>右键点击蹲下的玩家（手持空物品）即可跳上他们的背。</li>\n<li>用骑背姿势取代了默认的坐下姿势。</li>\n<li>完全兼容多人游戏。</li>\n<li>支持玩家堆叠（是的，你可以建造一个人类图腾！）。</li>\n<li>骑手无法转身向后看，类似于骑船时的视角限制。</li>\n<li>可选设置：携带他人时减缓背负者的移动速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎥 展示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如何骑行：<img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/howToUse.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"hot to use showcase\"></li>\n<li>玩家塔 <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/example2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"example 1\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/example1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"example 2\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚙️ 配置</h2>\n<p>模组可以通过以下方式配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>配置文件位于 config/piggyback.toml</li>\n<li>游戏内配置菜单</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚠️ 所需模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric API</li>\n<li>Faewulfs Lib</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔗 兼容性</h2>\n<p>Piggyback 旨在与其他模组兼容。如果遇到任何问题，请在模组的议题跟踪器上报告。</p>\n<h2>💖 支持</h2>\n<p>如需支持、功能请求或错误报告，请访问模组的 GitHub 问题页面。或者加入我的 Discord 服务器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a></p>\n<h2>📜 许可证</h2>\n<p>只要给予适当的署名，你可以在整合包中使用此模组。</p>",
